# OpenSpec in this repo

- **Project context** is injected from `openspec/config.yaml` (not `project.md`).
- **Main specs**: `openspec/specs/<capability>/spec.md`
- **Active changes**: `openspec/changes/<change-name>/` with delta specs under `specs/`
- **Archived changes**: `openspec/changes/archive/`

## Conventions

- Use Given/When/Then scenarios in spec requirements.
- Check existing specs before creating deltas — avoid duplicating capabilities.
- Entity features should reference presenter-vs-body composition.
- OpenSpec is tracked in this repo; it is not part of the distributed addon.

Use `/opsx:` commands or OpenSpec skills for propose, continue, apply, verify, and archive workflows.

## After archive

When a change is tested, verified, and archived successfully, ask whether to push a git update. Show `git status` first; never auto-commit or auto-push.
